61
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:05,000
In addition, you can also directly right-click on the inner line.

62
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:07,000
Select align to the symmetrical axis.

63
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:10,000
You will find that the two ends of the internal line at this time.

64
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:14,000
Will be extended to the symmetrical axis and the outside of the board.

65
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:17,000
This update makes editing the inner line of the symmetrical board.

66
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Become more convenient and efficient.

67
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:26,000
In the previous version.

68
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,000
For use on the symmetrical board.

69
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,000
Between the lines.

70
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:32,000
The inner line of the inner line function is generated.

71
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:35,000
If you want to align it to the symmetrical axis.

72
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:38,000
You need to manually adjust the end point of the line to the symmetrical axis.

73
