Now a new option has been added.

74
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:42,000
You can set the inner line generated.

75
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:45,000
Extend to the symmetrical axis of the board.

76
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:49,000
Press Shift to select the middle line and the bottom curve at the same time.

77
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,000
On the selected line.

78
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:52,000
On the line, right-click and select.

79
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,000
Between the lines.

80
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:56,000
The inner line is generated to open the window.

81
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:59,000
You can see in the pop-up window.

82
