The other side will also be generated at the same time.

92
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:29,000
And two inner lines are based on the symmetrical axis.

93
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,000
Now in version 2025.1.

94
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:33,000
Users can make more flexible decisions.

95
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:42,000
Based on the extension of the inner line generated by two lines.

